[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_TECHNOLOGY]
“Next!”

[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
In such a rapidly changing era, if the army cannot keep up with the application of new technologies in time, it will inevitably lag behind. The development of science and technology is always companioned with error, and failed experiments are inevitable.\nThe Empire will try its best to encourage talented ponies to engage in military scientific research, and ensure that they are provided with abundant... experimental materials.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_TECHNOLOGY]
“下一批！”

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
在这样一个日新月异的时代，如果不能及时跟进新技术的应用，军队势必会落伍。科技的发展总是在错误中不断前进，失败的实验不可避免。\n帝国将会尽力鼓励有才能的小马们从事军用科学研究，并保证向他们的研究提供丰富的...实验材料。

